== GrantDemo table (bundled sample) ==

Does not use the name Grant. Funder/Recipient can be a foundation, diocese, parish, or order.

<pre>
{{#cargo_declare:_table=GrantDemo
|Funder=Page
|Recipient=Page
|Amount=Float
|Year=Integer
|Program=String
}}
</pre>

== Funder → fundee graph ==

<pre>
{{#saintapedia_graph:
tables=GrantDemo
|fields=Funder,Recipient,Amount,Year
|where=Year>=2023
|order by=Amount DESC
|limit=500
|direction=LR
|source_field=Funder
|target_field=Recipient
|edge_label=Amount
|clickable=yes
}}
</pre>

